<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Join Live Training | HCP</title><link rel="icon" href="/public/images/HCPIT.png"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/training.css"></head>
<body class="live-join-body"><main class="live-join-page"><section class="live-join-card"><img src="/public/images/HCPIT.png"><div class="training-eyebrow">LIVE FTO TRAINING</div><h1>Join Session</h1><p>Enter the 6-digit code given to you by your FTO.</p>
<% if(error){ %><div class="training-alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="POST" action="/training/live/join"><input class="live-code-input" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" name="join_code" placeholder="000000" required><button class="training-save-button">Join Live Training</button></form><a href="/training" class="builder-back-link">← Back to Dashboard</a></section></main></body></html>